WEBVTT

00:00:01.730 --> 00:00:03.090
12 years old.

00:00:03.090 --> 00:00:08.060
It's a weird age when you aren't a child or an adult.

00:00:08.060 --> 00:00:11.870
When your body and heart changes.

00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:20.220
We are lost at the cusp of puberty and on the path of becoming an adult.

00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:22.530
My ideal kiss?

00:00:22.530 --> 00:00:27.580
My older sister kissed her boyfriend yesterday!

00:00:28.070 --> 00:00:29.310
Wow.

00:00:29.310 --> 00:00:32.800
Hey Yui, how would you like to kiss someone?

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:33.850
Kiss...

00:00:34.620 --> 00:00:37.280
I haven't really thought about that.

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:39.130
Here, here!

00:00:39.130 --> 00:00:42.780
I want to be with Sakurada on the way home from a date at the amusement park!

00:00:42.780 --> 00:00:48.200
Where he pushes me against the wall and stares into my eyes with such passion...

00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:51.450
Hanabi, Sakurada is an idol, right?

00:00:51.450 --> 00:00:54.040
It'll be difficult to get to know him.

00:00:54.040 --> 00:00:55.770
It'll all work out somehow!

00:00:58.110 --> 00:00:59.350
Ayase, you too?

00:01:00.280 --> 00:01:01.410
Takao!?

00:01:01.410 --> 00:01:04.120
You say such girlish things, too?

00:01:06.740 --> 00:01:09.470
Girlish? I am a girl!

00:01:09.470 --> 00:01:13.580
Look! I'm a girl no matter how you see it!

00:01:18.910 --> 00:01:23.120
I want to fall in love, but boys lack any sense of tact!

00:01:23.120 --> 00:01:27.030
Having a boyfriend still sounds a bit embarrassing...

00:01:27.730 --> 00:01:31.000
Ayase Hanabi, age 12.

00:03:12.100 --> 00:03:15.790
"Kiss, Dislike, Kiss"

00:03:19.620 --> 00:03:22.730
We are finally 6th graders!

00:03:22.730 --> 00:03:25.680
Our last year in elementary school.

00:03:28.320 --> 00:03:30.490
What's wrong, Hanabi?

00:03:30.490 --> 00:03:33.880
Why does he always make fun of me?

00:03:34.500 --> 00:03:35.170
I talked to my parents about you yesterday!

00:03:35.170 --> 00:03:37.900
Oh, you talking about Takao?

00:03:37.900 --> 00:03:41.170
He's perfect at sports and studies! So cool!

00:03:41.170 --> 00:03:43.910
Currently the most popular among the girls!

00:03:43.910 --> 00:03:45.640
Is he that cool?

00:03:46.340 --> 00:03:48.680
You don't think so, Hanabi?

00:03:48.680 --> 00:03:49.800
Nope!

00:03:49.800 --> 00:03:54.690
I can't really tell what he's thinking about.

00:03:57.330 --> 00:03:59.430
Pink polka dots!

00:03:59.430 --> 00:04:01.510
Eikou! Stop flipping girls' skirts!

00:04:03.610 --> 00:04:05.410
Hiyama!

00:04:06.070 --> 00:04:07.000
Yui!

00:04:07.380 --> 00:04:08.850
I'm the best!

00:04:08.850 --> 00:04:12.100
Hiyama! Stop telling the boys to do weird things!

00:04:12.430 --> 00:04:13.170
Huh?

00:04:13.950 --> 00:04:16.330
I can't believe you're telling them to flip skirts!

00:04:16.330 --> 00:04:20.000
Aoi, I never told them to do such a thing.

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:23.020
I just said that when our parents were young,

00:04:23.020 --> 00:04:25.880
boys who flipped skirts were heroes.

00:04:25.880 --> 00:04:27.670
Heroes

00:04:27.670 --> 00:04:29.790
That's so cool!

00:04:29.790 --> 00:04:31.940
Pink polka dots!

00:04:31.940 --> 00:04:34.380
You're the one egging them on!

00:04:34.380 --> 00:04:35.970
Stop your yapping.

00:04:35.970 --> 00:04:39.380
I'll flip your skirt too, Aoi!

00:04:39.380 --> 00:04:43.000
Hmph! I'm wearing shorts today.

00:04:43.210 --> 00:04:44.400
Iron Guard

00:04:44.400 --> 00:04:47.820
I don't want to see your panties anyway.

00:04:47.820 --> 00:04:49.480
What did you say!?

00:04:49.480 --> 00:04:51.160
Let's go, Yui!

00:04:52.510 --> 00:04:53.520
Okay!

00:04:53.890 --> 00:04:56.890
Aoi looks so mature!

00:04:56.890 --> 00:04:57.590
Huh?

00:04:57.590 --> 00:05:00.630
You keep getting scolded by her. How nice!

00:05:00.630 --> 00:05:03.340
Let's go flip her skirt the next time she wears one!

00:05:03.340 --> 00:05:04.060
Okay?

00:05:07.150 --> 00:05:08.060
Sorry!

00:05:10.440 --> 00:05:13.060
Why are the boys so childish?

00:05:14.860 --> 00:05:16.150
Aoi.

00:05:16.150 --> 00:05:17.480
What?

00:05:17.480 --> 00:05:19.960
Don't you ever wear skirts again!

00:05:23.350 --> 00:05:24.960
What is he talking about?

00:05:28.510 --> 00:05:31.850
I have Class 6-2's girls' popularity contest results!

00:05:31.850 --> 00:05:35.060
Popularity contest? The boys sure are bored.

00:05:35.060 --> 00:05:36.830
How mean!

00:05:38.610 --> 00:05:41.230
Eikou's number one is...

00:05:41.230 --> 00:05:42.960
Hamana Cocoa!

00:05:42.960 --> 00:05:44.640
She's number one!

00:05:44.640 --> 00:05:46.960
I'm so embarrassed!

00:05:46.960 --> 00:05:50.200
Did you vote for me, Takao?

00:05:50.200 --> 00:05:52.780
No, I didn't vote.

00:05:52.780 --> 00:05:54.650
There you go again.

00:05:54.650 --> 00:05:56.090
And here's last place!

00:05:56.090 --> 00:05:59.300
The girl who isn't popular at all is...

00:06:00.770 --> 00:06:02.640
You're going that far?

00:06:02.640 --> 00:06:03.550
Ew!

00:06:03.550 --> 00:06:04.460
Stop it!

00:06:04.460 --> 00:06:05.210
Huh?

00:06:05.210 --> 00:06:07.600
You're making everyone uncomfortable!

00:06:07.600 --> 00:06:09.650
Mind your own business, Ayase!

00:06:09.650 --> 00:06:11.570
Stop it! Just stop!

00:06:19.240 --> 00:06:21.920
Takao! What are you doing!?

00:06:21.920 --> 00:06:23.560
The teacher's here.

00:06:23.560 --> 00:06:25.590
What are you guys doing!?

00:06:25.590 --> 00:06:27.090
Oh no!

00:06:30.530 --> 00:06:34.570
Why is our class the only one where the boys and girls don't get along?

00:06:34.570 --> 00:06:36.650
Well, even if you ask us...

00:06:36.650 --> 00:06:38.820
It's because we're different!

00:06:38.820 --> 00:06:40.440
I've decided.

00:06:40.440 --> 00:06:43.920
I told you all that there will be a recorder test next week.

00:06:43.920 --> 00:06:47.890
You will take the test with the person sitting next to you.

00:06:48.130 --> 00:06:50.560
Eh!?

00:06:50.980 --> 00:06:53.550
Please practice as a pair.

00:06:53.920 --> 00:06:56.170
We're pairing up with the person right next to us...

00:06:56.170 --> 00:06:57.450
What?

00:06:57.830 --> 00:07:01.170
I'll never pair up with a girl!

00:07:01.170 --> 00:07:02.950
Me neither!

00:07:02.950 --> 00:07:07.110
Teacher! I want to be with Takao!

00:07:07.110 --> 00:07:08.840
You can't be picky.

00:07:08.840 --> 00:07:11.780
Get along with the person sitting next to you.

00:07:14.540 --> 00:07:16.270
Let's do this, Ayase.

00:07:16.270 --> 00:07:17.210
Okay!

00:07:17.910 --> 00:07:21.510
I'm with Takao? I'm a bit nervous.

00:07:24.050 --> 00:07:26.250
Open your eyes, old lady.

00:07:26.250 --> 00:07:30.160
I'm the only one who can be with Takao.

00:07:30.510 --> 00:07:32.750
Hey, Hanabi, you understand, right?

00:07:32.750 --> 00:07:33.500
Huh?

00:07:33.500 --> 00:07:38.410
Takao's only treating you nice because he's sitting next to you.

00:07:38.410 --> 00:07:40.320
Don't you dare ask him out.

00:07:40.320 --> 00:07:42.190
Sure.

00:07:42.190 --> 00:07:44.270
I'm not interested in boys.

00:07:44.270 --> 00:07:46.870
Really? Thank you!

00:07:46.870 --> 00:07:49.420
Your hair is so smooth and cute!

00:07:49.420 --> 00:07:51.430
I'm sure you'll get a boyfriend someday!

00:07:56.800 --> 00:08:00.610
Boyfriend? I don't really understand.

00:08:01.010 --> 00:08:02.250
Hanabi.

00:08:02.760 --> 00:08:03.820
Yui?

00:08:04.350 --> 00:08:05.970
What should I do?

00:08:06.690 --> 00:08:08.610
Nurse's Office

00:08:08.840 --> 00:08:09.890
Here you go.

00:08:11.620 --> 00:08:13.190
I'm sorry about this.

00:08:13.190 --> 00:08:15.900
Aoi, when a girl gets her first period,

00:08:15.900 --> 00:08:19.270
that means her body is getting ready to become a woman.

00:08:19.270 --> 00:08:20.760
It's something to be happy about.

00:08:22.450 --> 00:08:25.090
There's no need to be embarrassed.

00:08:30.160 --> 00:08:31.800
What should I do?

00:08:31.800 --> 00:08:32.450
Huh?

00:08:32.450 --> 00:08:35.160
I don't have a mom...

00:08:36.680 --> 00:08:40.650
Talking to my dad about this is embarrassing after all.

00:08:40.650 --> 00:08:45.420
But I don't think the pad the nurse gave me is going to last long.

00:08:45.420 --> 00:08:48.490
I'm scared to buy more by myself!

00:08:48.880 --> 00:08:49.910
Let's go!

00:08:50.640 --> 00:08:54.310
We'll go buy some together!

00:08:54.310 --> 00:08:55.780
Really?

00:08:55.780 --> 00:08:56.740
Yeah!

00:08:57.330 --> 00:09:01.740
Drugstore

00:09:07.610 --> 00:09:09.410
There are so many types!

00:09:09.410 --> 00:09:12.140
Ones for daily use, for heavy days, and ones on sale!

00:09:12.140 --> 00:09:14.550
Okay! Let's go for the ones on sale!

00:09:14.550 --> 00:09:16.980
Do your best, Yui!

00:09:18.990 --> 00:09:20.630
You did it!

00:09:20.840 --> 00:09:22.470
Welcome!

00:09:22.660 --> 00:09:25.790
A woman came to help the young guy at the register!

00:09:25.790 --> 00:09:28.270
Now's our chance! Let's break through here!

00:09:28.270 --> 00:09:29.230
Okay!

00:09:29.230 --> 00:09:31.050
Okay! To the register!

00:09:31.050 --> 00:09:33.440
Oh, that's so cheap!

00:09:35.350 --> 00:09:36.870
Don't worry about me!

00:09:36.870 --> 00:09:40.490
Use this opportunity to break free!

00:09:40.490 --> 00:09:42.000
Hanabi!

00:09:42.000 --> 00:09:44.330
Register

00:09:45.260 --> 00:09:47.300
Thank you very much!

00:09:48.680 --> 00:09:50.620
Somehow we bought it.

00:09:50.620 --> 00:09:53.070
It's all because you were with me.

00:09:53.070 --> 00:09:54.920
I'm heading this way.

00:09:54.920 --> 00:09:55.620
Okay.

00:09:55.620 --> 00:09:57.210
Then see you tomorrow.

00:09:57.210 --> 00:09:59.220
Be careful on your way home.

00:09:59.710 --> 00:10:03.170
Yui's becoming an adult.

00:10:03.170 --> 00:10:05.060
But I'm not that far yet.

00:10:05.060 --> 00:10:07.490
I wonder when my period will come?

00:10:07.490 --> 00:10:11.820
I'm not pretty and I don't understand love at all.

00:10:11.820 --> 00:10:16.960
I'm so childish. Will I ever become an adult?

00:10:22.780 --> 00:10:25.260
That's a unique sound.

00:10:25.260 --> 00:10:27.690
You don't need to be so considerate.

00:10:27.690 --> 00:10:29.160
Then you suck pretty badly.

00:10:29.160 --> 00:10:31.690
You didn't have to go that far!

00:10:31.690 --> 00:10:34.330
You have it so nice, Takao. You play so well.

00:10:34.330 --> 00:10:36.900
I'm pretty bad at the recorder.

00:10:36.900 --> 00:10:40.030
But you're practicing a lot to make it sound perfect, right?

00:10:40.030 --> 00:10:41.620
Of course!

00:10:42.020 --> 00:10:44.260
That's who you are, Ayase.

00:10:47.630 --> 00:10:48.490
Daily Schedule

00:10:48.490 --> 00:10:50.830
You should practice too, Hiyama.
Daily Schedule

00:10:50.830 --> 00:10:51.980
Don't wanna.
Daily Schedule

00:10:51.980 --> 00:10:52.770
Daily Schedule

00:10:52.770 --> 00:10:54.690
If you don't want to then I'm going home.
Daily Schedule

00:10:54.690 --> 00:10:54.870
If you don't want to then I'm going home.

00:10:56.930 --> 00:10:59.360
You really hate pairing up with me that much?

00:11:02.070 --> 00:11:05.160
How did things turn out like this? What a brat.

00:11:06.840 --> 00:11:10.350
Did you hear that? I played one part perfectly!

00:11:10.350 --> 00:11:13.970
You weren't listening at all!

00:11:13.970 --> 00:11:17.010
Hey, Takao! What are you looking-

00:11:17.010 --> 00:11:19.070
Oh, it's our teacher!

00:11:19.070 --> 00:11:22.060
She's with the teacher from next door?

00:11:22.060 --> 00:11:25.070
They've started going out.

00:11:25.070 --> 00:11:28.880
Really? I never knew!

00:11:30.380 --> 00:11:32.550
I wonder if they can hear us?

00:11:33.160 --> 00:11:34.310
Teacher!

00:11:43.560 --> 00:11:46.840
Did they just kiss?

00:11:47.910 --> 00:11:49.200
Sorry.

00:12:11.150 --> 00:12:13.160
Let's go home.

00:12:13.160 --> 00:12:13.980
Okay.

00:12:15.870 --> 00:12:19.120
Ayase Hanabi, age 12.

00:12:19.590 --> 00:12:23.630
I just had my first kiss.

00:12:35.320 --> 00:12:38.640
Well, our eyes just met by coincidence...

00:12:38.640 --> 00:12:41.250
We got caught up in the mood!

00:12:41.250 --> 00:12:42.870
That's so lewd!

00:12:42.870 --> 00:12:44.670
Too lewd, Hanabi!

00:12:44.990 --> 00:12:47.100
Good morning, Takao!

00:12:47.590 --> 00:12:50.670
I should just greet him normally for now.

00:12:50.810 --> 00:12:51.800
Good-

00:12:52.220 --> 00:12:54.020
Good morning, Ayase.

00:12:54.020 --> 00:12:57.340
Huh? He sounds normal.

00:12:57.340 --> 00:13:00.260
Is he pretending that never happened?

00:13:00.260 --> 00:13:01.000
Or...

00:13:01.000 --> 00:13:01.960
Inner Mind Conference

00:13:01.960 --> 00:13:05.030
Huh? He's used to this already?

00:13:05.030 --> 00:13:08.210
So a kiss or two is nothing to him?

00:13:08.930 --> 00:13:10.290
That means...

00:13:10.290 --> 00:13:14.590
Takao is a playboy!?

00:13:15.290 --> 00:13:17.410
Or that was his first kiss?

00:13:17.410 --> 00:13:20.310
And he likes me?

00:13:21.760 --> 00:13:24.260
Takao! You're not getting past me!

00:13:24.470 --> 00:13:25.150
Too naive!

00:13:25.150 --> 00:13:26.390
Oh no you don't!

00:13:26.390 --> 00:13:27.440
Pass! Pass!

00:13:28.400 --> 00:13:30.530
Takao! You're so cool!

00:13:30.530 --> 00:13:32.840
Stop fooling around and practice!

00:13:32.840 --> 00:13:33.870
Okay!

00:13:34.970 --> 00:13:36.260
Are you okay?

00:13:36.260 --> 00:13:37.800
What's the matter?

00:13:37.800 --> 00:13:41.230
My stomach hurts a lot...

00:13:41.230 --> 00:13:43.340
Is it that?

00:13:43.340 --> 00:13:46.070
You should talk to the teacher and get some rest.

00:13:47.870 --> 00:13:51.570
But if you get out of PE class the boys will make fun of you again.

00:13:51.570 --> 00:13:53.790
They won't stop yapping about it.

00:13:53.790 --> 00:13:55.420
But...

00:13:55.420 --> 00:13:56.780
Yui!

00:13:57.270 --> 00:13:58.300
I'm fine.

00:14:01.200 --> 00:14:03.650
Yui! Yui!

00:14:03.650 --> 00:14:04.700
What's wrong?

00:14:04.700 --> 00:14:07.600
Oh no! Call the ambulance!

00:14:07.600 --> 00:14:09.680
Aoi, is it...

00:14:09.680 --> 00:14:11.530
My period...

00:14:11.530 --> 00:14:13.820
I understand. Let's go to the nurse's office.

00:14:13.820 --> 00:14:17.720
What? Aoi fell because of her period!

00:14:17.720 --> 00:14:18.680
Hey!

00:14:20.780 --> 00:14:23.780
Oh? You had us all worried!

00:14:23.780 --> 00:14:26.420
Put up a wall! She's contagious!

00:14:28.080 --> 00:14:29.270
Hey!

00:14:33.110 --> 00:14:34.300
Ow!

00:14:34.300 --> 00:14:36.310
What are you doing, Ayase!

00:14:36.310 --> 00:14:38.010
Why don't you understand!?

00:14:38.010 --> 00:14:41.610
She held it in because you boys keep making fun of her!

00:14:41.610 --> 00:14:45.450
She's in so much pain that she's about to faint!

00:14:45.450 --> 00:14:48.090
She's hurting so much and yet you don't feel sorry at all!?

00:14:54.070 --> 00:14:56.310
Teacher, I'm taking her to the nurse's office.

00:14:56.310 --> 00:14:58.300
Oh, that's right.

00:14:58.300 --> 00:14:59.960
Let's go, Hanabi.

00:15:04.850 --> 00:15:06.790
Feel better now?

00:15:06.790 --> 00:15:07.740
Yeah.

00:15:08.050 --> 00:15:10.460
Those boys went too far!

00:15:10.460 --> 00:15:11.200
Yeah!

00:15:11.200 --> 00:15:13.960
Thanks, Hanabi.

00:15:15.200 --> 00:15:16.420
It's fine.

00:15:18.710 --> 00:15:21.300
Why are you guys here!?

00:15:21.300 --> 00:15:23.080
Up to no good again?

00:15:25.070 --> 00:15:27.190
That's my bag...

00:15:27.190 --> 00:15:29.320
Takao told us to bring it here.

00:15:30.210 --> 00:15:31.520
Takao?

00:15:31.800 --> 00:15:32.970
Sorry!

00:15:34.510 --> 00:15:34.840
Apology

00:15:34.840 --> 00:15:37.810
I didn't know that having a period hurts that much.

00:15:37.810 --> 00:15:39.820
I'm sorry, Aoi.

00:15:39.820 --> 00:15:42.900
Eikou! Where's your apology?

00:15:42.900 --> 00:15:45.470
I'm sorry! Hmph!

00:15:46.690 --> 00:15:48.280
Let's go!

00:15:49.750 --> 00:15:52.060
Jeez, those boys.

00:15:52.060 --> 00:15:55.150
But they have their good points after all.

00:15:55.150 --> 00:15:58.050
Takao told them to bring you your bag.

00:15:58.050 --> 00:15:59.730
How kind.

00:16:00.500 --> 00:16:01.270
Yep!

00:16:03.000 --> 00:16:04.550
Takao!

00:16:05.760 --> 00:16:06.950
How's Aoi doing?

00:16:06.950 --> 00:16:08.500
She's fine now.

00:16:08.500 --> 00:16:09.410
I see.

00:16:09.410 --> 00:16:11.630
Um, did you tell the boys about Yui's bag...

00:16:11.630 --> 00:16:12.770
You were really cool.

00:16:13.050 --> 00:16:13.900
Huh?

00:16:14.390 --> 00:16:18.360
Back then, you were really cool, Ayase.

00:16:18.800 --> 00:16:21.940
Is my heart beating so fast because I ran here?

00:16:21.940 --> 00:16:23.760
Or...

00:16:31.750 --> 00:16:33.090
I'm sorry.

00:16:34.050 --> 00:16:37.830
We weren't going home from the amusement park.
I'm not an idol, either.

00:16:37.830 --> 00:16:38.810
Huh?

00:16:38.810 --> 00:16:43.960
It wasn't your ideal first kiss, right?

00:16:47.110 --> 00:16:50.570
You looked down today.

00:16:50.570 --> 00:16:54.170
I should have apologized to you yesterday.

00:16:57.890 --> 00:16:59.080
I'm sorry.

00:16:59.080 --> 00:17:02.490
That was my first time, so I wasn't used to it.

00:17:02.800 --> 00:17:06.700
That was his first kiss, too!

00:17:07.960 --> 00:17:14.340
I'm feeling down today because it seemed like you didn't care about what happened yesterday.

00:17:14.970 --> 00:17:17.690
I felt lonely.

00:17:20.890 --> 00:17:23.880
So he felt the same way I did.

00:17:23.880 --> 00:17:27.390
It was his first time and he was so nervous.

00:17:33.140 --> 00:17:34.840
Let's keep on practicing.

00:17:34.840 --> 00:17:36.010
Okay!

00:17:37.410 --> 00:17:41.440
Cocoa told me not to get close to him...

00:17:41.440 --> 00:17:45.620
But I want to!

00:17:45.620 --> 00:17:49.970
I should just tell Cocoa and apologize.

00:17:55.460 --> 00:17:56.890
Good morning.

00:17:56.890 --> 00:18:00.090
Good morning!

00:18:00.090 --> 00:18:01.230
Eh?

00:18:01.230 --> 00:18:04.510
We should mess up on purpose? What do you mean?

00:18:04.510 --> 00:18:08.270
Boys are so aggravating, right?

00:18:08.270 --> 00:18:11.780
They hold popularity contests and make fun of periods.

00:18:11.780 --> 00:18:13.410
Well...

00:18:13.410 --> 00:18:18.250
That's why we girls should all mess up on purpose during the recorder test today.

00:18:18.250 --> 00:18:20.520
Let the boys be embarrassed.

00:18:20.520 --> 00:18:23.930
But we practiced for so long.

00:18:24.540 --> 00:18:26.530
What are you worried about?

00:18:26.530 --> 00:18:31.110
You told me that you weren't interested in Takao.

00:18:33.280 --> 00:18:36.510
If you dare help the boys,

00:18:36.510 --> 00:18:38.490
then you know what will happen, right?

00:18:39.360 --> 00:18:39.690
Music Room

00:18:39.690 --> 00:18:43.990
What should I do? The girls will all mess up on purpose.

00:18:43.990 --> 00:18:45.760
Okay, stop!

00:18:45.760 --> 00:18:47.890
Didn't you all practice?

00:18:47.890 --> 00:18:51.160
You did so well yesterday! Do it right!

00:18:51.160 --> 00:18:53.760
It's because I have to pair up with a boy!

00:18:53.760 --> 00:18:58.250
If I don't mess up, then the girls will single me out!

00:18:58.780 --> 00:19:01.780
Next up are Ayase and Takao.

00:19:04.280 --> 00:19:06.890
I have to mess up on purpose!

00:19:18.180 --> 00:19:21.600
When Takao smiles it makes me so happy.

00:19:22.530 --> 00:19:26.740
We've been working so hard together.

00:19:26.740 --> 00:19:30.360
I don't want to see him disappointed.

00:19:34.940 --> 00:19:38.290
Great! You two practiced very well!

00:19:39.250 --> 00:19:41.470
Hanabi, what was that all about!?

00:19:41.470 --> 00:19:43.710
Do you know what you just did?

00:19:43.710 --> 00:19:44.860
I'm sorry...

00:19:44.860 --> 00:19:47.640
I know that the boys are annoying,

00:19:47.640 --> 00:19:53.270
but we shouldn't fail on purpose. That's not fair!

00:19:54.790 --> 00:19:56.990
I didn't want to do that!

00:19:58.180 --> 00:20:00.800
What! The girls failed on purpose?

00:20:00.800 --> 00:20:03.090
Hey! Did Hamana start it!?

00:20:03.090 --> 00:20:06.570
No! It wasn't me! Um...

00:20:06.570 --> 00:20:08.490
It's Hanabi's fault!

00:20:09.560 --> 00:20:15.200
Hanabi's so mean! She started it but then she backed out!

00:20:15.200 --> 00:20:18.310
Takao! Hanabi is a big liar!

00:20:18.310 --> 00:20:21.300
She's making me the bad guy!

00:20:21.300 --> 00:20:24.030
Eh!? You did this, Ayase?

00:20:24.030 --> 00:20:26.320
I practiced so hard, too!

00:20:26.320 --> 00:20:29.170
That's terrible! Apologize, Ayase!

00:20:30.300 --> 00:20:32.470
No way...

00:20:32.770 --> 00:20:34.430
It wasn't Ayase.

00:20:35.560 --> 00:20:38.830
Ayase wouldn't do something so mean!

00:20:40.460 --> 00:20:41.910
Takao...

00:20:50.820 --> 00:20:53.600
Takao and Ayase are getting it on!

00:20:53.600 --> 00:20:54.470
You're right!

00:20:54.470 --> 00:20:55.920
Kiss!

00:20:55.920 --> 00:20:56.480
Kiss! Kiss! Kiss!

00:20:56.480 --> 00:20:58.110
Hey, you boys!

00:20:58.110 --> 00:20:58.880
Stop it!

00:20:59.870 --> 00:21:01.690
We've already done it so don't you dare lay a hand on her!

00:21:01.690 --> 00:21:04.540
What did you say!?

00:21:08.650 --> 00:21:10.380
Stop crying already.

00:21:10.380 --> 00:21:14.120
After all that I'm sure they'll all be laughing at us.

00:21:14.120 --> 00:21:16.420
They'll draw those love umbrellas.

00:21:19.200 --> 00:21:21.790
But... I love you!

00:21:23.730 --> 00:21:25.130
Me too.

00:21:27.030 --> 00:21:32.450
I'm sure in the eyes of an adult, our love is still childish.

00:21:32.890 --> 00:21:35.860
Ayase Hanabi, age 12.

00:21:36.070 --> 00:21:37.920
I've fallen in love!

00:23:28.390 --> 00:23:30.560
Why are you here!?

00:23:30.560 --> 00:23:32.500
I can't be here?

00:23:32.500 --> 00:23:33.910
My family owns this place.

00:23:33.910 --> 00:23:37.060
Huh? Hiyama's family runs a bath house?

00:23:40.190 --> 00:23:42.320
Aoi Yui, age 12.

00:23:42.320 --> 00:23:45.430
My body and heart are gradually maturing.

00:23:45.430 --> 00:23:47.500
I want to fall in love,

00:23:47.500 --> 00:23:49.970
but why are the boys so childish?

00:23:49.970 --> 00:23:52.850
They're so violent, especially that Hiyama! He's no good!

00:23:52.850 --> 00:23:54.440
Next episode of Age 12!

00:23:54.440 --> 00:23:55.610
Confession.

00:23:55.610 --> 00:23:58.320
I want to have a heart-pounding moment with everyone!
